  "description": "vvvv gamma editor extension for AI-assisted patching. Adds two modes via the HDE menu:\n\nAlt+B — Bridge: starts an HTTP server inside vvvv (localhost:7123) exposing the live\nsession to any external MCP client (VS Code + Kilo, Claude Desktop, Cursor, etc.).\n\nAlt+C — Chat: launches Open WebUI as an embedded browser panel inside the editor,\npre-connected to the vvvv MCP tools. Requires uv (https://astral.sh/uv).\n\nExperimental preview — breaking changes expected. Pairs with the vvvv-mcp dotnet tool.",
